  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.25 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Mechanical Licensing Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.25 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Mechanical Licensing Board. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.25, below, shall apply to the professions regulated by the mechanical licensing board under RSA 153:27-38:\n\nTable 1002.25 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for Professions Regulated by the Mechanical Licensing Board\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nFuel gas fitter:\n\nTrainee registration processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of registration | 2 years | $88\n\nService, equipment installation, or piping license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $198\n\nDomestic appliance technician license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $176\n\nHearth system installation license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $198\n\nHeating systems using fuel oil, voluntary certification:\n\nInstalling residential and non-residential heating equipment systems, water heating systems, or appliances:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of certification | 2 years | $50\n\nServicing and repairing heating equipment, water heating systems, or appliances:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of certification | 2 years | $50\n\nPlumbing:\n\nApprentice plumber license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $88\n\nJourneyman plumber license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $198\n\nMaster plumber license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $330\n\nMechanical business entities license application processing and licensing (153:29-a):\n\nAny number of employees, initial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $275\n\nWater treatment business entity license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $275\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
}
